; Zone records for salar.dpdns.org -> Salar Tailoring app on Railway
; The app is served at www.salar.dpdns.org (DigitalPlat does not allow a CNAME on the bare domain).
; Import this file in your DNS dashboard, or add the two records by hand.
$ORIGIN salar.dpdns.org.
$TTL 300

; Send visitors of www.salar.dpdns.org to the Railway app
www                    300  IN  CNAME  0vn4s6e8.up.railway.app.

; Proves to Railway that you own www.salar.dpdns.org
_railway-verify.www    300  IN  TXT    "railway-verify=1f44da462cb819a7e7c2ead1376a340540fa6f9f98608d435638fe1d1d193a41"
